# PHASE 0 — Understand what you're actually building

Before touching code, understand the difference between:

### Traditional domain registrar

```text
User
 ↓
Truehost
 ↓
Registrar
 ↓
Registry
 ↓
DNS
 ↓
Website
```

versus:

### Web3 domain platform

```text
User
 ↓
Web3Kenya
 ↓
Wallet
 ↓
ENS contracts
 ↓
Ethereum
 ↓
Resolver
 ↓
Wallet / records / content
```

Your platform isn't necessarily going to *own* the domains.

You're building the **user experience and infrastructure that interacts with the underlying naming protocol.**

That's a very important distinction.

